<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken says doors open for partner.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken says doors open for partner.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-controlled bank Nordbanken said on Tuesday that the doors remained open to continue discussions with possible future partners.</p>
<p>Merger talks between Nordbanken and S-E-Banken collapsed two weeks ago.</p>
</text>
